          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most brands claim it, we own it. Milano is one of the very few truly Direct to Consumer retailers that straddles E-Commerce and Brick and Mortar. Our NYC based design studio is nestled in the heart of the diamond district and our cutting-edge manufacturing facility is based in India. Every Milano piece is meticulously crafted bringing quality products directly to consumers online and through our over 40 retail locations.</p>",
