            "heading": "Design & Sourcing",
            "text": "<p>Our process begins with capturing inspiration from the latest fashion trends, nature and frequent travels to beautiful Caribbean Islands. Once the design is finalized, our buyers than search meticulously for the most exquisite diamonds & gemstones required to bring it to life.</p>",
            "show_segments": true,
