            "bg_color": "#ffffff",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "Casting & Metallurgy",
            "text": "<p>This is the enchanting phase where the alchemy of lost wax casting unfolds. Wax is encased in a flask and surrounded by plaster. When molten gold is poured into the flask, the wax dissolves, leaving behind voids in the plaster that are filled by the gold, giving birth to the intricate jewelry piece.</p><p>While this is the standard process for most items. We also utilize rolling mills, CNC and Laser machines to produce or finish your jewelry.</p>",
            "show_segments": true,
            "segments": 5,
            "active_segment": "3",
            "fill_segments": true,
