            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "Crafting, Setting & Finishing",
            "text": "<p>Once the piece is casted, it's then brough to one of our many skilled Artisans who then prep the casted piece for setting. The artisans then hand set the diamonds or gemstones using microscopes to ensure perfection. </p><p>After the setting process each piece is polished and cleaned to ensure it shines and sparkles when you receive it.</p>",
