            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "Quality Control & Delivery",
            "text": "<p>The final stage of our manufacturing process is the ensure that each finished piece of jewelry meets the stringent quality requirements set by us. Each item is thoroughly inspected through a microscope.</p><p>After passing our high standards, each piece is that packaged and ready to be shipped to our customers. Be sure to check out our instructions on how to properly care for your Jewelry to ensure it maintains it's carefully crafted Shine!</p>",
